<title>UK: Irish Permanent sets 50 mln stg 3-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Irish Permanent sets 50 mln stg 3-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IRISH PERMANENT PLC</p>
<p> AMT    50 MLN STG    BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    28.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE  RANGE FRN	MARGIN  **+50 BP     PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     ISSUE	100.15    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES    **AT ANY TIME PROVIDED 6M-LIBOR IS BETWEEN 2 PCT AND</p>
<p>		8.2 PCT DURING THE FIRST YEAR, 3 PCT AND 9.2 PCT IN</p>
<p>		YEAR TWO AND 4 PCT AND 10.2 PCT IN YEAR THREE.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
